======
TILES
======

floor " " USES floor_art
wall  "#" USES wall_art BLOCKS
goal  "." USES goal_art

========
OBJECTS
========

crate USES crate_art ON_GOAL crate_done_art

=======
PLAYER
=======

WALK RIGHT walk_right_1 walk_right_2
WALK LEFT  MIRROR RIGHT
WALK UP    walk_up_1 walk_up_2
WALK DOWN  MIRROR UP

=======
LEGEND
=======

"@" = PLAYER ON floor
"+" = PLAYER ON goal
"$" = crate  ON floor
"*" = crate  ON goal

====
WIN
====

ALL crate ON goal

